      "time": "days",
      "length": "um",
      "concentration": "mg/kg"
    }
  },
  "notes": {
    "scientific_context": "This example demonstrates the importance of proper multi-step temperature handling. D(T) follows Arrhenius kinetics with Ea ~ 60-100 kJ/mol, meaning diffusivity at 80C (hot-fill) is orders of magnitude higher than at 20C (setoff). The setoff step uses periodic boundary conditions (stacked packaging) before food contact.",
    "expected_behavior": [
      "Step 1 (setoff): Migration between stacked layers at 20C - slow D(T), PBC",
      "Step 2 (hotfill): Rapid migration at 80C - D increases ~1000x",
      "Step 3 (storage): Continued migration at 25C to equilibrium"
    ]
  }
